# Everything listed here is *generated*: a build product, a cache or a local run
# artefact. Nothing that ships is ignored — in particular `demo/` (bundled demo
# data and screenshots) and `docs/` are tracked content.

# --- Rust build artefacts ---------------------------------------------------
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# --- Python bytecode, caches, virtual environments, packaging --------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
pytest-of-*/

# --- The compiled extension module (`maturin develop` rebuilds it) ---------
python/odock/*.pyd
python/odock/*.so
python/odock/*.dll

# --- Local run artefacts ---------------------------------------------------
/out/
/.rust-tmp/
*.log
